---
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/iceland_portrait.webp";
---

<section class="px-5 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-28">
  <SectionHeader id="about" index="04" title="ABOUT" meta="VENICE, CA" />

  <div class="md:flex md:items-start md:gap-14">
    <div class="md:w-[320px] lg:w-[380px] md:shrink-0">
      <div class="overflow-hidden border border-encore-line">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Adrian Cacho in Iceland"
          class="w-full h-[380px] md:h-[500px] object-cover"
          widths={[390, 760]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 380px, 100vw"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <p class="font-smono text-encore-dim text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[2px] m-0 pt-2 md:pt-3">
        ICELAND
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 md:pt-0 md:flex-1 max-w-[620px]">
      <p class="font-inter text-encore-fg text-base md:text-[17px] leading-[1.7] m-0">
        I'm a Senior Full-Stack Engineer with over 8 years of experience building
        scalable, high-performance web applications and immersive experiences.
        I've led engineering teams to deliver high-impact products including <a
          href="https://blocks.glass"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >blocks.glass</a
        > — the first-ever content sharing platform for holograms, serving 100,000+
        digital assets — and Vertebrae, a 3D asset pipeline acquired by Snapchat.
      </p>

      <p class="font-inter text-encore-dim text-base md:text-[17px] leading-[1.7] m-0 pt-5 md:pt-6">
        My technical expertise spans full-stack development (React, TypeScript,
        Next.js, Node.js, PostgreSQL, AWS) and 3D web graphics (Three.js, WebGL).
        I've optimized complex database queries to achieve 70% performance
        improvements, architected payment systems processing thousands of
        transactions, and integrated AI/ML services using RAG techniques with
        LangChain. Most recently I've been working at the frontier of agentic AI
        — building MCP servers, agent tools, and the eval systems that measure
        them — as First Resonance's first AI engineer and on the agentic video
        editor at TwelveLabs. I combine strong engineering fundamentals with
        product thinking to deliver solutions that drive both user satisfaction
        and business outcomes.
      </p>

      <p class="font-inter text-encore-dim text-base md:text-[17px] leading-[1.7] m-0 pt-5 md:pt-6">
        Notable projects include building a Spotify app for Magic Leap using
        Unity and C++, developing mobile AR experiences for Coachella that
        reached millions of festival attendees, and completing the Polkadot
        Blockchain Academy to expand my expertise into Web3 and distributed
        systems using Rust and Substrate. As a visual artist, I also VJ major
        events using professional tools like Resolume, Disguise, and
        TouchDesigner, bringing a unique creative perspective to technical
        problem-solving.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
